.DS_Store

# Go build artifacts
/air-traffic-server
/air-traffic-gateway
*.test

# Durable local state: harness (ratchet series, promoted corpus, pattern pack)
# and the keystore (keys.json — digests, but still not ours to commit)
/data/
# The same files by basename, wherever AIRTRAFFIC_DATA_DIR points (it is
# operator-configurable, cmd/air-traffic-server/main.go). Nothing tracked uses
# these names; corpus/*.json is deliberately NOT listed because
# internal/gateway/detect/testdata/corpus/seed.json is a tracked fixture.
keys.json
policy.json
ratchet.jsonl
patterns.json

# Phase 2 frontend, plus the root-level node_modules that `npm i playwright-core`
# (scripts/capture-harness-screenshot.js) leaves behind. Unanchored = any depth.
node_modules/
web/dist/

# Local secrets minted by scripts/dev-env.sh, plus any .env.local / .env.production
# style variant a contributor drops beside it (root or web/)
.env*

# Claude Code local scratch and runtime state. These are ignored on the author's
# machine via .git/info/exclude and ~/.gitignore_global, neither of which travels with
# a clone — so the whole directory is ignored here, or a contributor's `git add -A`
# sweeps in session metadata and, worse, the settings.local.json Claude Code writes on
# the first permission grant: tool allowlists and absolute paths from their machine.
# `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/` because git will not descend into an excluded
# directory, and the shared, deliberately-checked-in pieces below are negations.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/skills/
CLAUDE.local.md
